# 32. Pentesting vs Vulnerability Assessment vs Security Audit

| Pentest | Vulnerability Assessment | Security Audit |
|---|---|---|
| Simulates attacks | Identifies vulnerabilities | Checks compliance/controls |
| Validates exploitability | Usually prioritizes findings | Checks whether requirements are met |
| Can demonstrate impact | Usually broader scanning | Evidence/documentation focused |
| Offensive perspective | Detection perspective | Compliance/control perspective |

